00:15:02,980 --> 00:15:04,650
Ohh!

256
00:15:05,230 --> 00:15:06,690
Hey, now you have two!

257
00:15:08,900 --> 00:15:10,190
Oh, now you have two.

258
00:15:13,240 --> 00:15:14,870
What am I gonna do?

259
00:15:15,450 --> 00:15:16,450
Hey.

260
00:15:18,370 --> 00:15:19,360
Hey.

261
00:15:20,790 --> 00:15:22,370
How come you have two?

262
00:15:24,080 --> 00:15:25,250
This one's for you.

263
00:15:26,500 --> 00:15:29,050
- Get out!     - No, I can't.

264
00:15:31,470 --> 00:15:33,680
I know how much this means to you...

265
00:15:33,840 --> 00:15:36,180
and I also know this is about more than jewelry.

266
00:15:36,390 --> 00:15:39,930
It's about you and me and the fact that we're "best buds."

267
00:15:41,480 --> 00:15:44,980
Wow. Is this friendship? I think so!

268
00:15:46,520 --> 00:15:49,110
Check it out! We're bracelet buddies!

269
00:15:49,690 --> 00:15:51,780
That's what they'll call us!

270
00:15:53,910 --> 00:15:56,990
Okay, here you go. Pay me back whenever you like.

271
00:15:57,620 --> 00:15:59,330
You have dinosaur checks?

272
00:16:00,200 --> 00:16:03,920
Yeah. You get your money and you learn something.

273
00:16:04,120 --> 00:16:05,380
What's wrong with that?

274
00:16:05,580 --> 00:16:06,790
Nothing.

275
00:16:07,040 --> 00:16:09,710
Hey, you're a cheap-a-saurus!

276
00:16:11,840 --> 00:16:15,220
I'm kidding, I'm kidding. Thank you, I'm very grateful.

277
00:16:15,430 --> 00:16:16,890
Hey, Mon, what is this?

278
00:16:17,930 --> 00:16:19,180
Oh, um...

279
00:16:19,350 --> 00:16:23,350
That's my bathing suit from high school. I was a little bigger then.

280
00:16:24,560 --> 00:16:28,060
Oh, I thought that's what they used to cover Connecticut when it rains.

281
00:16:29,570 --> 00:16:31,440
Hey, what's on this videotape?

282
00:16:31,650 --> 00:16:33,320
You got me. Let's put it in.

283
00:16:38,030 --> 00:16:39,990
- Hi.     - Hey.

284
00:16:43,370 --> 00:16:45,620
Over here, Jack. Okay.

285
00:16:45,830 --> 00:16:47,960
Rachel's coming up the path.

286
00:16:48,170 --> 00:16:50,340
Doesn't she look pretty? Jack?

287
00:16:50,550 --> 00:16:51,710
Can you get this?

288
00:16:54,720 --> 00:16:56,220
Oh, my God!

289
00:16:56,890 --> 00:16:58,430
What is with your nose?

290
00:17:01,100 --> 00:17:04,890
They had to reduce it because of my deviated septum.

291
00:17:05,230 --> 00:17:09,150
Okay, I was wrong. That's what they use to cover Connecticut.

292
00:17:10,020 --> 00:17:13,150
- This is us getting ready for the prom.     - Ah!

293
00:17:13,570 --> 00:17:16,110
- We don't have to watch.     - Yeah, we do.

294
00:17:16,320 --> 00:17:17,740
- Come on!     - It's fun!

295
00:17:17,990 --> 00:17:19,370
Get a shot of Monica.

296
00:17:19,620 --> 00:17:22,080
- Where's Monica?     - Over here, Dad!

297
00:17:23,000 --> 00:17:25,200
Wait. How do you zoom out?

298
00:17:26,830 --> 00:17:28,960
There she is!

299
00:17:32,380 --> 00:17:34,170
Some girl ate Monica!

300
00:17:36,430 --> 00:17:39,390
Shut up! The camera adds ten pounds.

301
00:17:39,640 --> 00:17:42,220
So how many cameras are actually on you?

302
00:17:45,430 --> 00:17:47,350
Oh, you look so great!

303
00:17:47,600 --> 00:17:50,310
So do you! You look beautiful!

304
00:17:51,150 --> 00:17:52,440
- Oops.     - What?

305
00:17:52,610 --> 00:17:54,280
I think I got mayonnaise on you.

306
00:17:54,490 --> 00:17:57,030
Oh, it's just the shoulder, not my dress.

307
00:17:59,820 --> 00:18:01,160
Everybody smile!

308
00:18:01,870 --> 00:18:03,410
Oh, Dad, turn it off!

309
00:18:03,620 --> 00:18:06,950
- It is off.     - It is not! What's with the red light?

310
00:18:07,160 --> 00:18:10,460
It's the off light. Right, Ross?

311
00:18:18,470 --> 00:18:20,590
Looking good, Mr. Kotter.

312
00:18:24,810 --> 00:18:27,560
- You look pretty tonight.     - Oh, thanks.

313
00:18:30,560 --> 00:18:33,860
- What are you doing this summer?     - I'm gonna hang out...

314
00:18:34,110 --> 00:18:36,110
work on my music.

315
00:18:39,740 --> 00:18:42,990
Is my hook unhooked? These things keep falling down.

316
00:18:49,790 --> 00:18:52,750
Let me see. I don't know.

317
00:18:52,920 --> 00:18:53,960
What are you gonna do...

318
00:18:54,130 --> 00:18:55,710
Oh! The guys are here!

319
00:18:55,960 --> 00:18:57,130
This summer?

320
00:18:57,340 --> 00:18:58,420
Work on your music?

321
00:19:04,300 --> 00:19:06,260
Oh, my God! There's Roy Gublik!

322
00:19:06,930 --> 00:19:10,690
You know, Roy saw Star Wars 317 times.

323
00:19:10,980 --> 00:19:12,190
His name was in the paper.

324
00:19:14,150 --> 00:19:16,980
Where's Chip? Why isn't he here yet?

325
00:19:17,190 --> 00:19:19,900
He'll be here, okay? Take a chill pill.

326
00:19:21,320 --> 00:19:22,820
There.

327
00:19:27,830 --> 00:19:30,960
I just told Rachel that Roy touched my boob.

328
00:19:33,130 --> 00:19:37,420
I can't go to the prom without a date. I can't! It's too late!

329
00:19:37,710 --> 00:19:40,590
If you're not going, then I don't want to go either.

330
00:19:40,840 --> 00:19:43,340
Oh, I'm gonna kick Chip's ass!

331
00:19:45,010 --> 00:19:47,180
I have a wonderful idea.

332
00:19:47,390 --> 00:19:50,140
You should take Rachel to the prom.

333
00:19:51,270 --> 00:19:52,270
Doubtful.

334
00:19:52,440 --> 00:19:55,300
Jack, give me that. Talk to your son.

335
00:19:56,900 --> 00:19:59,110
- All right, go on.     - This thing's heavy.

336
00:19:59,320 --> 00:20:02,900
Your mother's right. Take her. You can wear my tux.

337
00:20:03,110 --> 00:20:04,570
She won't wanna go with me.

338
00:20:04,820 --> 00:20:07,700
Of course she would! You're a college man!

339
00:20:08,330 --> 00:20:10,200
- I don't know.     - Well, come on.

340
00:20:10,450 --> 00:20:12,250
Don't you wanna find out?

341
00:20:13,670 --> 00:20:15,960
I can't believe I can't go to the prom!

342
00:20:16,170 --> 00:20:17,710
This is so harsh!

343
00:20:22,340 --> 00:20:25,340
- Hold my board.     - Attaboy! Attaboy!

344
00:20:25,760 --> 00:20:27,430
I think we've seen enough.

345
00:20:27,640 --> 00:20:29,470
- Let's turn it off.     - No, no, no!

346
00:20:29,930 --> 00:20:31,640
Well, I'm not gonna watch.

347
00:20:32,680 --> 00:20:34,350
Come on, kid. Let's go!

348
00:20:36,610 --> 00:20:40,230
- My! Are you handsome!     - Let's show them!

349
00:20:40,480 --> 00:20:42,150
Just a sec, Dad.

350
00:20:43,070 --> 00:20:45,610
Okay, be cool. Just be cool.

351
00:20:55,370 --> 00:20:56,420
Okay, Dad.

352
00:20:56,580 --> 00:21:00,420
Rachel, ready or not, here comes your knight in shining...

353
00:21:00,630 --> 00:21:01,880
Oh, no.

354
00:21:02,050 --> 00:21:04,050
Bye! Don't wait up!

355
00:21:04,470 --> 00:21:06,010
Chip!

356
00:21:07,970 --> 00:21:09,550
Oh, dear!

357
00:21:09,720 --> 00:21:11,430
Jack. How do I turn this off?

358
00:21:11,850 --> 00:21:12,970
Press the button.

359
00:21:13,180 --> 00:21:15,100
Which one? Which button? Jack!

360
00:21:15,310 --> 00:21:16,890
The button! The button!

361
00:21:20,940 --> 00:21:23,110
I can't believe you did that.

362
00:21:26,700 --> 00:21:28,110
Yeah, well...

363
00:21:56,390 --> 00:21:58,730
See? He's her lobster!

364
00:22:07,200 --> 00:22:08,820
Dance with him!

365
00:22:08,990 --> 00:22:10,490
Mom, I'm hungry!

366
00:22:10,950 --> 00:22:12,700
Dance with your father.

367
00:22:12,910 --> 00:22:17,200
I don't know any of your flashdances, but I'm no slouch on the dance floor.

368
00:22:17,460 --> 00:22:19,170
All right.

369
00:22:25,050 --> 00:22:27,510
- Oh, Jack!     - Oh, Judy!

370
00:22:31,220 --> 00:22:33,100
Oh, Judy!

